<title>ESTONIA: HANSA LOWERS HOUSING LOAN INTEREST.</title>
<headline>HANSA LOWERS HOUSING LOAN INTEREST.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansapank on Tuesday lowered its 10-year housing loan interest rate from 11.5 percent to 11 percent, it said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Hansapank's housing loan is the cheapest among Estonian commercial banks,&quot; it added in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
